## Part 3 — Data Relationship Deep Map

```
Degree (1) ──────────────────────── (N) Department
  │                                       │
  └── (N) Major ◄──────────────── (optional)
               │
               ├── EmbeddedDoc: ReportPolicy
               ├── EmbeddedList: ReportSections (legacy)
               └── (1) MajorReportTemplate (separate collection)
                        └── Sections[]

University (1) ──────── (N) College
     │                        │
     │                        └── (1) CollegeReportTemplate
     │                                  └── Sections[]
     └── (1) UniversityReportTemplate
                  └── Sections[]

User ───refs──► University, College, Degree, Department, Major, Industry
     ───copy──► 11 industry snapshot fields (flat in User doc)
     ───copy──► universityLogoOverride, collegeLogoOverride

Report ─refs──► User, Degree, Major, College, University, Industry, Payment
       ─blob──► generatedContent (dict), editedContent (dict),
                sectionImages (dict), generatedTitles (dict)

WorkKeyword ── (no FK) ── string match on industryType, jobProfile
ProjectTitle ─refs──► Major, Degree (denormalized)
InternshipType ── (ORPHAN) ── not referenced by anything active
ReportContentType ── (LOOSE) ── Major.reportContentType is a free string, not a ref
```

